Chapter: BvtPickaxe
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeGameRules
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 Damian, 2026-10-09: Lord British carries a pickaxe. A mobile with a backpack (layer 21, as GameLocks makes an NPC's):
 answers a bit per check, 1 the first boot makes one pickaxe in the pack, 2 a second boot makes none, 4 its art is
 economy item 25 (cpr-kit-item), 8 a mobile with no pack gets none; 15 is all.
  bpx-checks : Integer -> Integer
  bpx-checks (unused) = when cg-game 512
    is Err (_) -> -1
    is Ok (game) -> let items = gsi-new game.world
      in when world-create game.world (gs-mobile 0 1500 1600 0 400 1002)
        is Err (_) -> -2
        is Ok (lord) -> when world-create game.world (gs-item lord #0E75 0)
          is Err (_) -> -3
          is Ok (pack) -> let worn = gsi-register items pack 21 #003C False False
            in let first = cg-give-pickaxe items lord
            in let second = cg-give-pickaxe items lord
            in let child = world-first-child game.world pack
            in let art = when world-get game.world child is Err (_) -> 0 is Ok (o) -> o.graphic
            in let bare = when world-create game.world (gs-mobile 0 1502 1600 0 400 1002) is Err (_) -> -1 is Ok (other) -> cg-give-pickaxe items other
            in (if first == 1 & world-child-count game.world pack == 1 then 1 else 0) + (if second == 0 & world-child-count game.world pack == 1 then 2 else 0)
              + (if cpr-kit-item art == 25 then 4 else 0) + (if bare == 0 then 8 else 0)
 A fresh world has no British at boot, so his entry gives his tools (cg-lord-tools, cg-entry): 2 for the master key and
 the pickaxe in an empty pack, 0 on the next entry, 0 for a mobile with no pack.
  bpx-entry : Integer -> Boolean
  bpx-entry (unused) = when cg-game 512
    is Err (_) -> False
    is Ok (game) -> let items = gsi-new game.world
      in when world-create game.world (gs-mobile 0 1500 1600 0 400 1002)
        is Err (_) -> False
        is Ok (lord) -> when world-create game.world (gs-item lord #0E75 0)
          is Err (_) -> False
          is Ok (pack) -> let worn = gsi-register items pack 21 #003C False False
            in let first = cg-lord-tools items lord
            in let second = cg-lord-tools items lord
            in let bare = when world-create game.world (gs-mobile 0 1502 1600 0 400 1002) is Err (_) -> -1 is Ok (other) -> cg-lord-tools items other
            in first == 2 & second == 0 & bare == 0 & world-child-count game.world pack == 2
  bvt-pickaxe : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-pickaxe (unused) = act
    n <- bpx-checks 0
    a <- bvt-check ("Lord British's boot pickaxe: made once in his pack as item 25, none without a pack (code " & show n & ")") (n == 15)
    b <- bvt-check "Lord British's entry gives the master key and pickaxe once, none without a pack (cg-lord-tools)" (bpx-entry 0)
    a + b
  end
